01:00:51,140 --> 01:00:53,050
Not sure...

502
01:00:53,050 --> 01:00:56,860
Maybe around 100 or 200?

503
01:00:56,860 --> 01:00:58,270
Fine.

504
01:00:58,270 --> 01:01:01,050
Whether it's 100 or 200, take them all out.

505
01:01:01,050 --> 01:01:03,630
Anyway, why all the dishes?

506
01:01:03,630 --> 01:01:06,280
Take them all out and clean them.

507
01:01:06,280 --> 01:01:09,270
If you don't want to feel my wrath, wipe them all.

508
01:01:09,270 --> 01:01:13,010
Until they all shine. Do you understand?

509
01:01:29,810 --> 01:01:32,470
So, you're saying...

510
01:01:32,470 --> 01:01:35,180
That mom lied.

511
01:01:35,180 --> 01:01:38,800
When you didn't say anything about it?

512
01:01:38,800 --> 01:01:41,280
That mom lied to us.

513
01:01:41,280 --> 01:01:42,710
That's right.

514
01:01:42,710 --> 01:01:44,350
Lies. All lies.

515
01:01:44,350 --> 01:01:47,870
Whether it's my mom or me. They are all lies.

516
01:01:47,870 --> 01:01:49,540
Alright?

517
01:01:58,920 --> 01:02:02,190
Hey! Song Eun Jo.

518
01:02:08,820 --> 01:02:11,600
Eun Jo, come here.

519
01:02:11,600 --> 01:02:15,710
Hyo Seon's here.

520
01:02:15,710 --> 01:02:18,030
Unni.

521
01:02:18,030 --> 01:02:20,760
Since our mom's here,

522
01:02:20,760 --> 01:02:23,310
let's figure out the truth.

523
01:02:23,310 --> 01:02:25,300
You guys are back.

524
01:02:27,360 --> 01:02:29,920
Did you do well on your exam?

525
01:02:32,060 --> 01:02:34,030
Let go of me.

526
01:02:34,030 --> 01:02:38,520
Unni, I said let's ask Mom.

527
01:02:50,390 --> 01:02:52,190
This little bitch.

528
01:02:54,170 --> 01:02:55,570
Hyo Seon, are you okay?

529
01:02:55,570 --> 01:02:57,270
Hyo Seon, are you okay?

530
01:02:57,270 --> 01:02:58,990
You're not hurt?

531
01:02:58,990 --> 01:03:01,260
My goodness.

532
01:03:05,520 --> 01:03:13,100
♫ It must be you. I can't be without you. ♫

533
01:03:13,100 --> 01:03:19,980
♫ Like this for another day, month or year ♫

534
01:03:19,980 --> 01:03:24,780
♫ I don't mind even if I am hurt. ♫

535
01:03:24,780 --> 01:03:25,760
Why did you hit her?

536
01:03:25,760 --> 01:03:27,210
It was because of your reaction I noticed.

537
01:03:27,210 --> 01:03:28,470
You don't know...

538
01:03:28,470 --> 01:03:30,090
Listen!

539
01:03:30,090 --> 01:03:32,620
It hurts. How could it possibly not hurt?

540
01:03:32,640 --> 01:03:36,010
So what? So what if I hurt?

541
01:03:36,010 --> 01:03:39,570
Even if you don't like me at all. I won't ask you to like me.

542
01:03:39,570 --> 01:03:44,290
So don't force me to not like you.

543
01:03:44,290 --> 01:03:47,100
He ran out saying that he's going to see your mom.

544
01:03:47,100 --> 01:03:48,130
Kang Sook.

545
01:03:48,130 --> 01:03:50,970
I'll write it. I'll forfeit my inheritance.

546
01:03:50,970 --> 01:03:54,300
I almost believed for a while.

547
01:03:55,830 --> 01:03:59,520
♫ Come to me. ♫
